            "source:bd62e0e1baa747e594426266",
            "source:90de842d6b263c12232b1609"
          ],
          "text": "Razorgore the Untamed reacts fiercely when his eggs are destroyed, calling them precious and threatening those responsible. At the brink of death, he threatens to drag his mortal attackers into the abyss with him.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 12435
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": null
    },
