            "source:5d4bbad03fb254064eeb6def"
          ],
          "text": "Grethok the Controller is responsible for defending the hatchery eggs. When intruders breach the hatchery, he calls for an alarm and urges the defenders to protect the eggs at all costs. He can use magic to control opponents.",
