        "world:creature:14025",
        "world:quest:8730"
      ],
      "text": "You are in Blackwing Lair, a place within Blackrock Spire. Nefarian dwells in its inner sanctum, and Broodlord Lashlayer guards the Halls of Strife that lead toward it. Vaelastrasz the Corrupt, a mortally weakened red dragon, fights Nefarius's corruption here. Blackwing technicians and corrupted whelps fill the lair. Nefarius holds the Red Scepter Shard and plans to destroy it.",
      "when": {
        "zone_id": 2677
      }
    }
  ],
